/target
**/target
# The module ships, so `bin/arborist.wasm` is tracked. Anything else built here
# is not.
*.rs.bk

# The view's component is 9.7 MB of GPUI and WebGPU and nothing consumes it
# without a host that can present it, so it is built rather than shipped. The
# CLI module IS tracked: the GitHub Action runs it straight out of the checkout.
view/module.wasm

# The browser build's glue and module are produced by `wasm-bindgen`, 13 MB
# between them. `view/web/index.html` is authored and tracked; everything beside
# it is generated. `view/README.md` has the two commands.
view/web/arborist_web*.js
view/web/arborist_web*.wasm
view/web/*.d.ts
